  "description": "Arise SG Apex is more than ready for whatever multi-surface adventure you have lined up. Based on our trusted double-butted Arise frame, with size-specific wheels so everybody has that same Bombtrack experience. We’ve also added SRAM’s excellent Apex 1 x 11 drivetrain. The 11 – 42T cassette coupled with a 40T front ring make light work of spinning up those hills, and with the Bombtrack cockpit and Tektro mechanical disc brakes, give you a commanding position going down the other side. Add in tubeless-ready WTB rims, a multitude of mounts and internal dynamo light routing, and you have the basis of a fantastic adventure companion.",
